        <p>. . Dodcl's Kidney Pil!s cured Mr Davey, and they will cure you, if you suffer the same war. The presmce cit uric acid in the blood is the cause of Rheutnatism,Sciatica and Lumbago ; the cause ot the presence of uric acid in the blood is unhealthy kidayyz, which fail to force it out through the urinary organs. Dodes Kidney Pills make healthy kidneys, healthy kidneys take the poison out of tho blood, and with LI goes all muscular pain. It is a natural law promoted by natural methode ; it is the reason Dodcl's Kidney— Pills never fail to cure. D 'do's Kidney Pills are 2,9 i per box,of all Chemists, or post fve on receipt of price from The Dodds Medi- cine Co„ 23, FarringdonAvenue, Loadon,E.C. Ba salve of the name, D-0.-d-d-'s.</p>
